- that porous borders and Sanctuary Cities only encourage more illegal immigration, and that ten's of thousands die, are raped or kidnapped every year as a result.  Building a wall and enforcing our laws is humane and just;
- that illegal immigration adversely impacts those citizens at the lower economic tiers of society, who are disproportionately minorities;
